  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement was signed in December 1997, a Program Officer was contracted to coordinate the preparatory activities. A Grupo Coordenador was instated in order to secure links between central and provincial level and see to that policies at central level were not ignored. The ideia was that the preparatory, &quot;mother&quot; agreement would &apos;give birth&apos; to a series of Special Agreements.</narrative>
  </description>
